CM_ BO_ 2566835536 "Freeze Frame Parameters
A freeze frame is defined as the list of recorded parameters at the time a diagnostic trouble code was captured";
CM_ SG_ 2566835536 EngIntakeManifold1Press "The gage pressure measurement of the air intake manifold. If there are multiple air pressure sensors in the intake stream, this is the last one in flow direction before entering the combustion chamber.  This should be the pressure used to drive ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566835536 FreezeFrameLength "The Freeze Frame Length shall be equal to the number of bytes in the required parameters plus the number of bytes in the manufacturer specific parameters.";
CM_ SG_ 2566835536 WheelBasedVehicleSpeed "Speed of the vehicle as calculated from wheel or tailshaft speed.";
CM_ BO_ 2566835280 "Diagnostics Data Clear/Reset for Previously Active DTCs";
CM_ BO_ 2566835024 "Previously Active Diagnostic Trouble Codes
The information communicated is DM service to communicate the previously active trouble codes.";
CM_ SG_ 2566835024 RedStopLampState "This lamp is used to relay trouble code information that is of a severe enough condition that it warrants stopping the vehicle.

00     Lamp Off
01     Lamp On
10     Reserved
11     Not available";
CM_ SG_ 2566835024 ProtectLampStatus "This lamp is used to relay trouble code information that is reporting a problem with a vehicle system that is most probably not electronic subsystem related. For instance, engine coolant temperature is exceeding its prescribed temperature range.
00 ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566835024 FlashRedStopLamp "This parameter provides the capability to flash the RSL


00 - Slow Flash (1 Hz, 50 % duty cycle)
01 - Fast Flash (2 Hz or faster, 50% duty cycle)
10 - Reserved
11 - Unavailable / Do Not Flash";
CM_ SG_ 2566835024 FlashProtectLamp "This parameter provides the capability to flash the engine protect lamp


00 - Slow Flash (1 Hz, 50 % duty cycle)
01 - Fast Flash (2 Hz or faster, 50% duty cycle)
10 - Reserved
11 - Unavailable / Do Not Flash";
CM_ SG_ 2566835024 FlashMalfuncIndicatorLamp "This parameter provides the capability to flash the MIL
00 - Slow Flash (1 Hz, 50 % duty cycle)
01 - Fast Flash (2 Hz or faster, 50% duty cycle)
10 - Class C DTC
11 - Unavailable / Do Not Flash
Note:  State 10 is for WWH OBD discriminatory ...";
CM_ BO_ 2566834768 "Active Diagnostic Trouble Codes
Active Diagnostic Trouble Codes";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 FlashRedStopLamp "This parameter provides the capability to flash the RSL


00 - Slow Flash (1 Hz, 50 % duty cycle)
01 - Fast Flash (2 Hz or faster, 50% duty cycle)
10 - Reserved
11 - Unavailable / Do Not Flash";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 FlashProtectLamp "This parameter provides the capability to flash the engine protect lamp


00 - Slow Flash (1 Hz, 50 % duty cycle)
01 - Fast Flash (2 Hz or faster, 50% duty cycle)
10 - Reserved
11 - Unavailable / Do Not Flash";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 FlashMalfuncIndicatorLamp "This parameter provides the capability to flash the MIL
00 - Slow Flash (1 Hz, 50 % duty cycle)
01 - Fast Flash (2 Hz or faster, 50% duty cycle)
10 - Class C DTC
11 - Unavailable / Do Not Flash
Note:  State 10 is for WWH OBD discriminatory ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 RedStopLampState "This lamp is used to relay trouble code information that is of a severe enough condition that it warrants stopping the vehicle.

00     Lamp Off
01     Lamp On
10     Reserved
11     Not available";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 ProtectLampStatus "This lamp is used to relay trouble code information that is reporting a problem with a vehicle system that is most probably not electronic subsystem related. For instance, engine coolant temperature is exceeding its prescribed temperature range.
00 ...";
CM_ BO_ 2565799504 "Address Claimed
Message used to claim an address for a Controller Application.";
CM_ SG_ 2565799504 IndustryGroup "0 = Global; 
   1  = On-Highway; 
   2  = Agricultural and Forestry; 
   3  = Construction; 
   4  = Marine;
   5  = Industrial - Process
          Control - Stationary (Gen-Sets)
   6  = Reserve for SAE
   7  = Reserve for SAE";
CM_ SG_ 2565799504 ManufacturerCode "Assigned by NMEA 2000 Committee";
CM_ BO_ 2565602896 "Transport Protocol - Data Transfer
Used for the transfer of data associated with Parameter Groups that have more than 8 bytes of data.";
CM_ SG_ 2565602896 SequenceNumber "Sequence Number (TP.DT)";
CM_ BO_ 2565668432 "Transport Protocol - Connection Mgmt
Used for the transfer of Parameter Groups that have 9 or more bytes of data.";
CM_ SG_ 2565668432 TotalNumberOfPacketsEoMA "Total number of packets received for RTS/CTS message.  Zero and one are not valid values.";
CM_ SG_ 2565668432 TotalNumberOfPackets "Total number of packets for RTS/CTS message.  Zero and one are not valid values.";
CM_ SG_ 2565668432 TotalMessageSize "Total message size (in bytes) for RTS/CTS message.  Messages shorter than 9 data bytes should be sent without utilizing the transport protocol.  Messages longer than 1785 can not use the RTS/CTS transport protocol.";
CM_ SG_ 2565668432 TotalMessageSizeEoMA "Total message size (in bytes) received for RTS/CTS message.  Messages shorter than 9 data bytes should be sent without utilizing the transport protocol.  Messages longer than 1785 can not use the RTS/CTS transport protocol.";
CM_ SG_ 2565668432 NextPacketNumberToBeSent "Next Packet Number to be sent (TP.CM_CTS)";
CM_ SG_ 2565668432 TotalMessageSizeBAM "Total message size (in bytes) for BAM  message.  Messages shorter than 9 data bytes should be sent without utilizing the transport protocol.  Messages longer than 1785 can not use the BAM transport protocol.";
CM_ SG_ 2565668432 TotalNumberOfPacketsBAM "Total number of packets for BAM message.  Zero and one are not valid values.";
CM_ SG_ 2565668432 PGNumber "Requested PGN in the TP.CM_RTS message";
CM_ SG_ 2565668432 MaximumNumberOfPackets "Maximum number of packets for RTS/CTS message.  zero through four are not allowed";
